    <briefdescription>
<para>Layout manager for grid-based UI arrangement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid" kindref="compound">Grid</ref> provides a fluent interface for organizing UI elements in a grid. Each <ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid_1a9cdd9b56bf792047f6e3139753a4e041" kindref="member">SliceRow()</ref>/SliceCol() returns a new <ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid" kindref="compound">Grid</ref> representing the cell.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid_1a6724c87c996e234a06039f8a65949ef8" kindref="member">Grid</ref><sp/>grid({0,0},<sp/>{16,8});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">grid.SliceRow(2).Draw(element1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">grid.SliceRow(2).SliceCol(2).Draw(element2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">grid.SliceRow(2).SliceCol(2).Clear();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">grid.Rest().Clear();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
